# original 125 MB temple (too big for GitHub); the optimized copy lives in Assets/_Project/Models/Temple
Art_Source/Temple/temple.fbx
Art_Source/Temple/*.blend1
Art_Source/Temple/game/
Art_Source/Robbers/*.png

# walkthrough raw captures (duplicates of Docs/Walkthrough/shots); keep only the run report
Docs/Walkthrough/raw/*
!Docs/Walkthrough/raw/audit.md

